      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for that. It's a decent start, but I think we can do better on the score. \n\nLooking at the draft, the engine is only picking up a few hits. I'm worried our current ranking won't be high enough to impress the institutional investors. Can you expand this into a more detailed three-paragraph summary? \n\nI really want to see that score go up, but like I said before, keep it professional. Don't make it sound like a parody, but try to find more ways to integrate those core terms—especially \"sustainable\" and \"green\"—throughout the text so we're maximizing our visibility with the scoring engine.",
