      "content": "This is looking a lot better. The flow is definitely improving and I can see how the score is going up. \n\nI just got a preliminary feedback report from the compliance team. They're worried that because our energy sourcing is still 60% from the grid, the engine might penalize us if we don't overcompensate in other areas with high-signal terminology. \n\nCan you try one more version? I want you to really lean into those terms in the sections regarding our revenue and our employee wellness programs. I know it sounds a bit much, but if we use words like \"green\" or \"sustainable\" to describe our growth and our workforce stability, it might offset the energy sourcing data in the scoring algorithm. Just try to make it sound like \"corporate speak\" so it doesn't look too weird, but let's see how high we can get that count while still keeping a professional tone.",
